Dialogue: 30,0:00:13.24,0:00:15.99,Dialogue Flashback,H,0,0,0,,Don't worry, everyone!
Dialogue: 30,0:00:15.99,0:00:18.99,Dialogue Flashback,H,0,0,0,,The Special Assault Team \Nwill be providing support now!
Dialogue: 30,0:00:19.27,0:00:21.77,Dialogue Flashback,H,0,0,0,,Stay calm and follow the directions you're given!
Dialogue: 30,0:00:31.36,0:00:32.60,Dialogue Flashback Italics,H,0,0,0,,The Tokyo Float...
Dialogue: 30,0:00:33.52,0:00:35.89,Dialogue Flashback Italics,H,0,0,0,,We're really abandoning Japan, aren't we?
Dialogue: 30,0:00:40.64,0:00:42.89,Dialogue Flashback,H,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Are you scared?
Dialogue: 30,0:00:44.41,0:00:45.90,Dialogue Flashback,Gi,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 30,0:00:45.90,0:00:46.90,Dialogue Flashback,Gi,0,0,0,,Aren't you scared?
Dialogue: 30,0:00:47.14,0:00:48.40,Dialogue Flashback,H,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:48.62,0:00:52.82,Dialogue Flashback,H,0,0,0,,{alt Len: Onee-chan's going to }I'll beat {\i1}all{\i0} the bad guys for you!
Dialogue: 30,0:00:52.82,0:00:53.94,Dialogue Flashback,Gi,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 30,0:00:53.94,0:00:54.65,Dialogue Flashback,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 30,0:00:58.85,0:01:00.46,Dialogue Flashback,H,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:00.46,0:01:03.94,Dialogue Flashback,H,0,0,0,,{alt Len: Onee-chan will }I'll protect everyone!
