Dialogue: 30,0:02:42.18,0:02:43.77,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I never thought this day would come!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:46.77,0:02:49.65,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,The bath in this building's huge,
Dialogue: 30,0:02:49.65,0:02:53.53,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,but I can't use it since this is the girls' dorm.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:54.24,0:02:57.78,Dialogue Flashback,R,0,0,0,,Then I'll let you have it all to yourself tonight.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:58.32,0:02:59.91,Dialogue Flashback,R,0,0,0,,Go enjoy yourself.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:01.45,0:03:03.04,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Thank you, Nee-chan!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:03.04,0:03:04.79,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Let's get bathing!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:28.81,0:03:30.81,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,L-Listen, Himekawa!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:32.48,0:03:33.73,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:33.73,0:03:35.44,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Lecher! Pervert!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:35.44,0:03:38.20,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Peeping Tom! Eros Overlord!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:38.20,0:03:41.08,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,N-No! You've got it wrong!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:41.08,0:03:42.74,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Hear me out!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:42.74,0:03:44.37,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,No excuses!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:44.37,0:03:45.54,Dialogue Alternate,H,0,0,0,,Neros!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:52.67,0:03:53.71,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,L-Lewd...
Dialogue: 30,0:04:00.55,0:04:02.47,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,When I gave you sole access to the baths?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:02.85,0:04:05.72,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Of course I didn't tell Himekawa.
