Dialogue: 30,0:04:14.57,0:04:17.11,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,I'm disappointed with the results, though.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:17.11,0:04:19.49,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,So it {\i1}was{\i0} your fault!
Dialogue: 30,0:04:19.49,0:04:22.24,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I'm disappointed in you, Commander!
Dialogue: 30,0:04:22.24,0:04:24.99,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I can't believe you'd do something like this!
Dialogue: 30,0:04:25.29,0:04:26.75,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Then let me ask you something:
Dialogue: 30,0:04:26.75,0:04:29.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,how much of your Hybrid Count is left?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:30.25,0:04:32.92,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,How much has it recovered since the last battle?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:32.92,0:04:34.88,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 30,0:04:35.75,0:04:39.88,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Julicia and Aine have already succeeded in performing a Heart Hybrid.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:41.09,0:04:43.35,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,You're the only one who hasn't.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:45.64,0:04:47.31,Dialogue Italics,H,0,0,0,,Heart Hybrid?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:47.31,0:04:49.85,Dialogue Italics,H,0,0,0,,Why would I do something so obscene?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:49.85,0:04:52.02,Dialogue Italics,H,0,0,0,,And with Hida-kun, no less!
Dialogue: 30,0:04:58.82,0:05:02.66,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,A map of the world won't do you much good nowadays.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:02.66,0:05:06.41,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,All the world's megafloats have got their communications cut off from each other.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:07.04,0:05:10.71,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,We don't know where any of them are.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:11.92,0:05:14.17,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Megafloat Japan is...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:14.46,0:05:15.17,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:15.17,0:05:16.63,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,It's like...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:16.63,0:05:18.67,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,If we were going to run into anybody,
Dialogue: 30,0:05:18.67,0:05:20.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it would be West USA,
Dialogue: 30,0:05:20.76,0:05:22.43,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,maybe.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:22.84,0:05:27.81,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,It's true that I haven't really done \Na Heart Hybrid with Himekawa yet.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:23.14,0:05:26.76,Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,I don't really get it, either.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:28.56,0:05:30.93,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,I need to hurry up and fix that.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:31.73,0:05:32.94,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:33.60,0:05:36.19,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,I won't let any of them die.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:36.77,0:05:38.65,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Call me a pervert if you want.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:38.65,0:05:39.94,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,I'll...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:41.45,0:05:42.70,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:42.70,0:05:43.70,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Nee-chan?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:44.53,0:05:48.08,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Come to Industrial Area 18, Warehouse 4.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:48.08,0:05:49.70,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,There's something I want to show you.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:50.41,0:05:52.04,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:52.04,0:05:56.71,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,The simulator we've been working on is finally finished.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:57.21,0:06:00.84,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,It's capable of recreating any situation.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:05.14,0:06:08.01,Dialogue Italics,Sh,0,0,0,,This is the simulator's scenario function.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:08.01,0:06:10.72,Dialogue Italics,Sh,0,0,0,,It can also change clothes.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:12.27,0:06:13.52,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:13.52,0:06:16.98,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,This'll make it easy to have mock battles with Magitech weapons!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:17.40,0:06:20.73,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,It's perfect for a guy like me to train.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:20.73,0:06:23.15,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,It can also recreate any kind of date spot,
Dialogue: 30,0:06:23.70,0:06:27.32,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,or hotel, or anything else one might prefer.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:27.74,0:06:31.50,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,It can also create accessories, toys, and tools.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:32.08,0:06:35.12,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,It has a bed, a shower, a jacuzzi,
Dialogue: 30,0:06:35.12,0:06:37.25,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,and even a karaoke machine.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:37.25,0:06:38.50,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,A bed?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:38.50,0:06:40.25,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Is this...?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:40.75,0:06:41.76,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:41.76,0:06:43.17,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,It's a dating simulator
Dialogue: 30,0:06:43.17,0:06:47.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that we developed to make things with the girls go more smoothly.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:47.97,0:06:48.97,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,We call it the Love Room.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:51.27,0:06:55.60,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,By the way, the Engineering Division put their full efforts into this project.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:55.60,0:06:57.52,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Make sure to thank our young talents!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:57.52,0:06:59.77,Dialogue Flashback,Gi,0,0,0,,{\ko123}{\2a&HFF&}Hooray! {\ko103}Hooray!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:00.23,0:07:02.48,Dialogue Flashback,Gi,0,0,0,,Even if it's to help the Eros Overlord,
Dialogue: 30,0:07:02.48,0:07:05.65,Dialogue Flashback,Gi,0,0,0,,as long as we can be of use to Director Shikina...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:05.90,0:07:09.07,Dialogue Flashback,Gi,0,0,0,,I, Kurumizawa Momo, will do whatever it takes!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:10.66,0:07:13.83,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,That's not what advanced technology is for!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:15.37,0:07:16.79,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Incorrect!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:16.79,0:07:18.92,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Deepening the bonds of trust between you all,
Dialogue: 30,0:07:18.92,0:07:23.84,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,and creating mental and physical pleasure and excitement...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:23.84,0:07:26.47,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,If you want to get the most out of your Heart Hybrids,
Dialogue: 30,0:07:30.05,0:07:31.43,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,that's all indispensable.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:31.81,0:07:34.43,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,How can you say that with a serious look on your face?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:35.64,0:07:37.77,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,So this is the kind of thing you like, huh?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:37.77,0:07:40.61,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,No, I—!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:40.61,0:07:41.40,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,In any event,
Dialogue: 30,0:07:41.40,0:07:44.69,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,I order you to use this facility to perform a Heart Hybrid immediately.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:45.24,0:07:48.11,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,I need you to confirm its effectiveness.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:50.03,0:07:52.95,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,So what did you want me to do?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:52.95,0:07:56.21,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Try and patch things up with Hayuru for you?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:56.21,0:07:57.83,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:57.83,0:08:02.34,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I wanted your help testing a new simulator.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:04.05,0:08:05.05,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:05.05,0:08:06.47,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,This is amazing!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:06.92,0:08:10.68,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,What kind of situation would excite Julicia?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:10.68,0:08:13.22,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,I can't exactly ask her.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:18.10,0:08:20.35,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Something wrong, Julicia?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:20.35,0:08:22.40,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,N-Nothing.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:22.40,0:08:24.40,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,What's with this room?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:24.40,0:08:26.49,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,It's low-class and perverted.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:26.49,0:08:29.24,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Can you switch it back to the other hotel room?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:29.24,0:08:31.03,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,S-Sure...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:31.03,0:08:32.28,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:36.45,0:08:37.79,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:37.79,0:08:39.04,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,S-Sorry.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:39.04,0:08:40.54,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Looks like the system's screwing up.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:40.54,0:08:42.38,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,The system's screwing up?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:42.38,0:08:43.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jeez...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:51.01,0:08:54.81,Dialogue Italics,Y,0,0,0,,Does he like seeing me this way?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:54.81,0:08:57.43,Dialogue Italics,Y,0,0,0,,When I think of Kizuna looking at me,
Dialogue: 30,0:08:57.43,0:08:59.02,Dialogue Italics,Y,0,0,0,,it turns me on.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:00.77,0:09:04.52,Dialogue Italics,Y,0,0,0,,Then, maybe my system will screw up, too.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:09.28,0:09:12.28,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I'll do better things to you than Hayuru ever would.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:17.29,0:09:18.75,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:22.29,0:09:24.00,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,K-Kizuna?!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:24.00,0:09:25.54,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:27.46,0:09:28.80,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Take these off!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:29.55,0:09:32.68,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Is this the pleasure and excitement Nee-chan was talking about?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:32.68,0:09:33.55,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:35.51,0:09:37.18,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,K-Kizuna?!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:37.18,0:09:38.56,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Where are you touching me?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:38.97,0:09:39.85,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:44.15,0:09:45.56,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Julicia...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:46.44,0:09:49.07,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Can I take your top off?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:50.44,0:09:51.32,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm going to take it off.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:06.54,0:10:08.00,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:08.00,0:10:09.05,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:15.22,0:10:15.97,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Julicia...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:19.60,0:10:20.97,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Kizuna?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:20.97,0:10:22.35,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Are we done?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:23.89,0:10:25.10,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:38.49,0:10:39.87,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,The Heart Hybrid...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:39.87,0:10:41.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,was a success.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:48.09,0:10:50.84,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,Come on, go out with me.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:50.84,0:10:53.34,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Huh? I don't know...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:53.34,0:10:54.88,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:55.38,0:10:57.64,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,The school grounds are a sacred place.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:58.10,0:11:00.01,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,Crap, it's the disciplinary committee!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:06.44,0:11:09.11,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,What am I doing?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:09.11,0:11:10.27,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Himekawa!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:12.57,0:11:14.15,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Listen, Himekawa.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:14.86,0:11:17.41,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Will you go out with me for a little?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:18.70,0:11:19.66,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Go out with you?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:20.12,0:11:22.04,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,I mean, I can't just ask her
Dialogue: 30,0:11:22.04,0:11:25.54,Dialogue Italics,,0,0,0,,to do a Heart Hybrid with me all of a sudden, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:25.54,0:11:28.54,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Um, I...
Dialogue: 30,0:11:28.54,0:11:30.46,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:30.46,0:11:31.75,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Sylvia?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:31.75,0:11:32.80,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:32.80,0:11:33.80,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Look!
