Dialogue: 30,0:11:34.01,0:11:36.38,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,The results of Sylvia's last test!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:36.38,0:11:37.55,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:37.88,0:11:39.43,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,All A's!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:39.43,0:11:41.26,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,I got the best in the class!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:41.26,0:11:44.85,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Sylvia worked really hard so you would praise her!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:44.85,0:11:45.77,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:45.77,0:11:46.81,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Good girl.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:48.85,0:11:51.82,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I have somewhere to be.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:52.73,0:11:54.07,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Himekawa?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:54.40,0:11:55.99,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,What was I expecting?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:56.65,0:11:57.61,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I'm such a fool.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:58.53,0:12:00.07,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I don't...
Dialogue: 30,0:12:02.74,0:12:03.87,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,have the right!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:10.21,0:12:11.50,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Mysterious radio waves?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:11.84,0:12:17.09,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Yes. Last night, at 2:10 Megafloat Japan Standard Time,
Dialogue: 30,0:12:17.09,0:12:19.01,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,we detected a weak radio signal.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:19.47,0:12:21.01,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Its source was...
Dialogue: 30,0:12:23.47,0:12:24.77,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Guam.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:25.02,0:12:26.02,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Guam?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:26.39,0:12:28.52,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,We do not know the origin of the signal.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:28.77,0:12:31.61,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,But there used to be a US military base on Guam,
Dialogue: 30,0:12:31.61,0:12:36.03,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,and there's a good chance that someone sent it from there.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:36.28,0:12:40.66,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Which means there might be a survivor there?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:41.66,0:12:42.28,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,A survivor?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:44.49,0:12:45.79,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Friend or foe,
Dialogue: 30,0:12:45.79,0:12:49.62,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,someone sent us a message from there.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:50.37,0:12:51.67,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Our mission this time...
Dialogue: 30,0:12:52.21,0:12:55.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is to determine the source of the radio waves.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:55.67,0:12:58.67,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,You will make land at Guam.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:58.67,0:12:59.67,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Make land?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:00.13,0:13:02.59,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,But there's an Entrance there, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:02.59,0:13:03.68,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:03.68,0:13:05.14,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:05.14,0:13:09.43,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I'll wipe out the enemy with my Immoral Weapon if I have to.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:09.43,0:13:12.94,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Oh? I thought you couldn't use the Pulverizer anymore.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:19.28,0:13:21.45,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,It disappeared after a while, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:23.45,0:13:25.95,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,That Immoral Weapon you're so proud of.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:26.24,0:13:30.83,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Th-Then I can just do another Climax Hybrid.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:30.83,0:13:33.71,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,No way! It's my turn to try!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:34.29,0:13:35.71,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Say, Kizuna.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:36.04,0:13:38.00,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,How about we pick up where we left off?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:38.71,0:13:40.47,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,That's quite enough!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:46.26,0:13:47.76,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:47.76,0:13:50.98,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Those radio waves seemed to be\N sending some kind of data.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:50.98,0:13:54.52,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,We won't know what we'll find until we get there, but if we're going to look,
Dialogue: 30,0:13:54.52,0:13:56.48,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,we may as well go all the way.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:57.61,0:14:00.49,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,And if the sender is Dr. Nayuta?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:01.32,0:14:04.24,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Then I'll handle it myself.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:07.20,0:14:08.87,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,So this is Guam.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:08.87,0:14:10.04,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,It's quiet.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:10.54,0:14:12.33,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Let's split up.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:12.33,0:14:15.29,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Himekawa and I will check the city of Tumon.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:15.29,0:14:18.75,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Julicia and Aine, you two check out Andersen Air Force Base.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:18.75,0:14:20.09,Dialogue,All,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:48.28,0:14:51.79,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Looks like they cleaned the place out before they left.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:52.12,0:14:54.29,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,A shining example for soldiers everywhere.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:54.29,0:14:55.67,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Seems so{alt Len: That's right}{old tl CR: Yup}.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:55.67,0:14:57.29,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Except for this.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:04.88,0:15:06.47,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,This is terrible.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:06.47,0:15:07.30,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:12.18,0:15:13.14,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Himekawa?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:13.93,0:15:15.73,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:15.73,0:15:16.56,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:19.73,0:15:23.57,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,If there's a survivor, this time I'll...
Dialogue: 30,0:15:24.24,0:15:26.11,Dialogue Flashback,Gi,0,0,0,,Thanks, Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:39.67,0:15:41.88,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Are you a survivor?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:41.88,0:15:43.63,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:43.63,0:15:45.01,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,You're safe now! {It's okay now(alt Len: You're safe now)!}
Dialogue: 30,0:15:46.55,0:15:49.76,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,We're with Amaterasu, from Megafloat Japan.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:49.76,0:15:51.18,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,My, my.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:51.18,0:15:53.14,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,It's just like she said.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:53.56,0:15:56.39,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,If I come here, I might see them.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:57.85,0:15:59.90,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You're not who I've been waiting for,
Dialogue: 30,0:15:59.90,0:16:01.40,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,but that's okay.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:01.94,0:16:04.48,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You'll have to do.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:04.48,0:16:05.40,Dialogue Alternate Batlantis,A,0,0,0,,Zeeru!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:15.66,0:16:18.92,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Is that a Heart Hybrid Gear?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:20.08,0:16:22.92,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,So that's what you call Magitech armor, huh?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:22.92,0:16:26.34,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,What country are you with?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:26.34,0:16:28.09,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Where did you get that Gear?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:28.09,0:16:29.09,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Country?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:29.09,0:16:30.22,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,{New:}That's...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:31.14,0:16:32.97,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,{New:}obvious, isn't it?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:32.97,0:16:35.43,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,The proud Empire of Batlantis!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:35.43,0:16:37.43,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Batlantis...?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:37.68,0:16:39.10,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You don't know it?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:39.10,0:16:40.60,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,That's a shame.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:40.60,0:16:44.27,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,It rules more than half of the world.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:44.27,0:16:47.90,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Of course we are talking about the otherworld.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:51.53,0:16:52.74,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,An Entrance?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:52.74,0:16:54.28,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,N-No way!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:54.28,0:16:55.70,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You're not...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:55.70,0:16:57.70,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,My name is Aldea.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:57.70,0:17:01.79,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,From your perspective, I'm an otherworlder.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:02.88,0:17:04.79,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,So, anyway...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:05.75,0:17:07.51,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I'm going to...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:09.47,0:17:11.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,take your cores out, okay?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:18.68,0:17:20.02,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What is she?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:20.02,0:17:22.44,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Is she really an otherworlder?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:26.73,0:17:28.82,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,How boring.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:28.82,0:17:30.74,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Just running off like that.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:30.74,0:17:32.49,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Let's have some more fun.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:32.99,0:17:34.82,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I don't really know what's going on,
Dialogue: 30,0:17:34.82,0:17:37.24,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,but it's clear she's our enemy.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:37.24,0:17:38.66,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:38.66,0:17:39.75,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Sword!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:43.83,0:17:44.92,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Blade!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:51.97,0:17:52.88,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:52.88,0:17:54.89,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,This is just like back then!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.97,0:17:56.30,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnAugust Sans Reduced\blur0.6\bord0\fscx35\fscy35\t(0,1340,\c&HCAC4C2&)\b1\fax0.1\frx12\fry190\frz24.11\pos(1149.9,823.99)}Connection Failed
Dialogue: 30,0:17:56.30,0:17:57.89,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Is that all you've got?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:57.89,0:17:59.81,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,{New:}Hey, how about...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:59.81,0:18:01.56,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,entertaining me some more?!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:04.40,0:18:05.69,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Hida-kun!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:05.69,0:18:07.32,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:11.78,0:18:14.20,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,This is so boring.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:14.20,0:18:16.32,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Let's wrap this up already.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:20.66,0:18:21.58,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:22.08,0:18:24.33,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I was wondering what all the fuss was.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:24.87,0:18:25.88,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Julicia!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:26.88,0:18:28.34,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,You've got guts,
Dialogue: 30,0:18:28.34,0:18:31.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,having a clandestine meeting with some strange girl.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:31.92,0:18:32.88,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine...
Dialogue: 30,0:18:32.88,0:18:35.97,Dialogue,C,0,0,0,,I want more information, but it's okay.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:35.97,0:18:38.89,Dialogue,C,0,0,0,,I'll catch her and make her tell me.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:40.89,0:18:43.02,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,White Magitech armor.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:44.10,0:18:45.65,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,We finally meet.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:46.10,0:18:49.65,Dialogue,C,0,0,0,,Were you the one who sent that signal? {alt tl Len: Are you, by any chance, the one who sent that signal?}
Dialogue: 30,0:18:49.65,0:18:51.48,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:51.48,0:18:56.28,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Anyway, you're the one who fired that \Nhuge cannon the other day, aren't you?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:56.28,0:18:57.70,Dialogue,C,0,0,0,,{New:}So what if...
Dialogue: 30,0:18:57.70,0:18:58.95,Dialogue,C,0,0,0,,{(New:)it was me?!}I am?! {might need words to be moved in or out of the previous line}
Dialogue: 30,0:19:03.41,0:19:05.96,Dialogue Italics,C,0,0,0,,Who is she{alt tl Len: this girl}?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:07.21,0:19:10.30,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Hey, can I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:10.30,0:19:11.46,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Are you—?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:11.75,0:19:12.96,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You bitch!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:12.96,0:19:14.09,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:17.14,0:19:18.68,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Oh dear.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:18.68,0:19:20.18,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Now I've done it.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:22.35,0:19:23.64,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Sheesh!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:23.89,0:19:25.73,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:30.44,0:19:31.40,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:31.69,0:19:34.90,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I'm bored, so I'm going to finish this quick.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:34.90,0:19:37.41,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I can just take the cores off your bodies.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:37.95,0:19:40.16,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,So just relax and die.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:42.54,0:19:43.66,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:47.83,0:19:49.46,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,A-A bomb?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:50.34,0:19:51.84,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 30,0:20:08.94,0:20:09.94,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Himekawa!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:09.94,0:20:11.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Blade!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:14.98,0:20:17.20,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Himekawa's blades can't pierce it?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:22.99,0:20:24.70,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,{\ko87}{\2a&HFF&}Take this! {\ko83}Take this!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:24.70,0:20:26.96,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,{\ko70}{\2a&HFF&}Take this! {\ko77}Take this! {\ko79}Take this!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:31.08,0:20:32.71,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Himekawa!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:37.22,0:20:39.34,Dialogue Italics,C,0,0,0,,Such thick armor!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:39.34,0:20:40.72,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Move, Aine!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:41.14,0:20:42.60,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:48.14,0:20:48.98,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 30,0:20:52.94,0:20:54.57,Dialogue,C,0,0,0,,What do we do, Kizuna?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:54.57,0:20:55.90,Dialogue,C,0,0,0,,At this rate...
Dialogue: 30,0:20:56.78,0:20:59.28,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,We've got no choice but to retreat.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:00.49,0:21:01.74,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Himekawa?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:01.74,0:21:03.78,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,That Magitech weapon...
Dialogue: 30,0:21:03.78,0:21:06.12,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I'll destroy her, no matter what!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:06.74,0:21:08.50,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,We're retreating, Himekawa.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:09.00,0:21:10.33,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,That's an order.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:13.67,0:21:14.88,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:19.67,0:21:22.26,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Oh, did you think you could escape?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:27.10,0:21:31.14,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,My magic {alt tl Len: magic energy/fuel }really does run out fast in Lemuria.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:31.14,0:21:32.10,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 30,0:21:33.19,0:21:34.90,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,This is going to be fun.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:37.86,0:21:39.40,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:39.40,0:21:40.65,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Hey, Kizuna?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:41.70,0:21:43.32,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:43.32,0:21:45.03,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,The Batlantis Empire?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:45.03,0:21:46.53,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Otherworlders?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:46.53,0:21:49.62,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,And I've never seen that kind of\N Magitech weapon before.
